ncremented, and the payload is ignored if it matches the SN of the previously received PDU.\n- If the SN matches `nextExpectedSeqNum`, the PDU is treated as new data, and `nextExpectedSeqNum` is incremented by 1.\n- The device uses the SN, NESN, and MD bits from the PDU for flow control since the CRC is correct, ensuring reliable data handling by preventing processing of out-of-sequence or duplicate data.'}[0m
