ith the error code `Invalid Parameters` if the field length or packet structure is incorrect. This behavior ensures protocol integrity but may introduce delays or DoS risks if not mitigated. Implementing strict input validation, timeout mechanisms, error logging, and rate limiting can effectively address these issues, maintaining the security and reliability of the pairing process.'}[0m
